{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "note": "Conformance vectors for @noesar/spoken-intent. The registry below is a REDUCED but faithful copy of the shape NOESAR EVOLUTION's own voice layer resolves against: commands and addresses side by side, one destination legitimately reachable by two rows (memory), an entry that takes an argument (plan), and a group whose heading is the only thing naming it (approvals). Handles arrive already normalised, exactly as SI-004 requires of a caller. The Italian prose handles are what makes the accent-folding and filler requirements measurable rather than theoretical.",
